     * @param city     the owner's city, as stored
     * @param postcode a 4-digit postcode string (e.g. '3000'), or {@code null} when absent
     * @return the region derived from the postcode, else the region derived from the city, else
     *         {@link #UNKNOWN_REGION}
     */
